{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>Lodge here.</b> He was precise in saying the word <b>here</b> — perhaps he intended to tell them that they should lodge with him in his inn. And he finished saying the reason: <b>and I will bring back word</b> etc., <b>as HaShem will speak</b> etc. He was precise in saying ״כַּאֲשֶׁר״ (״as״) rather than saying ״אֲשֶׁר יְדַבֵּר״ etc. — he intended to give the reason that he tells them to lodge here with him, so that immediately, straightaway, <b>as</b> HaShem speaks to him he will bring them back word, which would not be the case if they were outside his inn. And he said <b>this night</b> — perhaps he said this on account of his narrow-eyed stinginess, that he did not provide them lodging for more than one night."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:12:05.012927482Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}